text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08172453 {
    "The mover’s POKéMON do all the work\nof moving us in and cleaning up after.\lThis is so convenient!\p{PLAYER}, your room is upstairs.\nGo check it out, dear!\pDAD bought you a new clock to mark\nour move here.\lDon’t forget to set it!"
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08172531 {
    "MOM: Well, {PLAYER}?\pAren’t you interested in seeing your\nvery own room?"
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08172574 {
    "MOM: {PLAYER}.\pGo set the clock in your room, honey."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_081725A3 {
    "MOM: Oh! {PLAYER}, {PLAYER}!\nQuick! Come quickly!"
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_081725C9 {
    "MOM: Look! It’s PETALBURG GYM!\nMaybe DAD will be on!"
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_081725FE {
    "MOM: Oh... It’s over.\pI think DAD was on, but we missed him.\nToo bad."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08172644 {
    "Oh, yes.\nOne of DAD’s friends lives in town.\pPROF. BIRCH is his name.\pHe lives right next door, so you should\ngo over and introduce yourself."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_081726D2 {
    "MOM: See you, honey!"
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_081726E7 {
    "MOM: Did you introduce yourself to\nPROF. BIRCH?"
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08172717 {
    "MOM: How are you doing, {PLAYER}?\nYou look a little tired.\pI think you should rest a bit."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_0817276B {
    "MOM: Take care, honey!"
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08172782 {
    "MOM: Oh? Did DAD give you that BADGE?\pThen here’s something from your MOM!"
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_081727CD {
    "Don’t push yourself too hard, dear.\nYou can always come home.\pGo for it, honey!"
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08172841 {
    "INTERVIEWER: ...We brought you this\nreport from in front of PETALBURG GYM."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_0817298B {
    "DAD: Hm?\pHey, it’s {PLAYER}!\pIt’s been a while since I saw you,\nbut you look...stronger, somehow.\pThat’s the impression I get.\nBut your old man hasn’t given up yet!\pOh, yes, I have something for you.\nThis came to you from someone named\lMR. BRINEY."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08172A7D {
    "DAD: Hm, a TICKET for a ferry?\pIf I recall, there are ferry ports in\nSLATEPORT and LILYCOVE.\p{PLAYER}, if you have ambition as a\nTRAINER, go to the BATTLE TOWER.\pIt should teach you that there is\nno end to a TRAINER’s chosen path."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08172B5E {
    "I’d better get back to PETALBURG GYM.\pMOM, thanks for looking after the house\nwhile I’m away."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08172BBC {
    "MOM: That DAD of yours...\pHe comes home for the first time in a\nwhile, but all he talks about is POKéMON.\pHe should relax and stay a little longer."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_081730C2 {
    "Oh, hello. And you are?\p... ... ... ... ... ... ... ... ...\n... ... ... ... ... ... ... ... ...\pOh, you’re {PLAYER}{KUN}, our new next-door\nneighbor! Hi!\pWe have a {STR_VAR_1} about the same\nage as you.\pOur {STR_VAR_1} was excited about making\na new friend.\pOur {STR_VAR_1} is upstairs, I think."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_081731E3 {
    "Where has my husband gone?\nJust when {PLAYER}{KUN} is visiting, too...\pThat man can never sit still for long...\nHe might be at his LAB."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08173262 {
    "Oh, {RIVAL} has gone out somewhere.\pLike father, like child.\n{RIVAL} can’t stay quietly at home."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_081732B9 {
    "¿Ya no te acuerdas de mí?\pSoy la famosa y envidiada líder del  \ngimansio-piscina de Celeste,\ljaja…\p{COLOR 0x04}{PLAYER}: No me digas…\p¿Y cómo tù por aquí?\p{COLOR 0x01}Pues nada moquillo.  \nQue venía a visitar a tu madre."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08179805 {
    "¡¿Ya estás aquí {PLAYER}{KUN}?!\pGuau, cambiaste muchisimo y además \nte has hecho un pequeño campeón.\pEsperame en el laboratorio, ¿va?\pTengo algo para tí."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08179996 {
    "Hi there, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\pOur WALLY’s become very healthy\nsince he went to VERDANTURF TOWN.\pWe owe it all to you!\pWhen WALLY left town, you helped\nhim catch a POKéMON, right?\pI think that made WALLY really\nhappy.\pActually, not just WALLY.\nIt made me, his father, happy too.\pHappy that he’s got such a great\nfriend as you.\pThis isn’t a bribe or anything, but\nI’d really like you to have this."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08179B14 {
    "If your POKéMON can SURF, you’ll be\nable to go to all sorts of places."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08179B5B {
    "WALLY’s coming home soon.\nI’m looking forward to that."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_08179B92 {
    "Oh? You met WALLY in EVER GRANDE\nCITY?\pOh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, don’t be silly.\pHe may have gotten healthy, but he\ncan’t go somewhere far away like\lthat all by himself."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_086B3E00 {
    "¿Conoces a ese chaval tan feo que  \nestá mirando por la ventana?\p{COLOR 0x04}{PLAYER}: Más o menos…\n¿Que pasa?\p{COLOR 0x01}Lleva cotilleando desde que vino aquí\nel prof. Oak.\lPodrías ir a ver que quiere."
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_086BEBCF {
    "Felicidades por tu triunfo en la \nliga añil, cariño. \lEn el pueblo no se habla de otra cosa\pBueno… me alegro que de vez en cuanto\nte pases a ver a tu madre…"
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_086BEEEB {
    "{COLOR 0x02}Boooow…\nMisteeer Mime"
}

text Naranja_PalletTown_AshsHouse_1F_Text_086BFAD3 {
    "Esperame en el laboratorio, ¿va?"
}
